Package: smotif
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Multi-Cellular Motifs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ruben", "Dries", email = "rdries@bu.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Discovery and statistical evaluation of recurrent
    multi-cellular motifs (size 2, 3, and 4) in spatial omics data.
    Provides a lightweight 'SpatialGraph' representation backed by
    parquet, enumeration over igraph, spatially-aware null models,
    motif-to-gene association, and cross-region or cross-sample
    comparison. Designed to be framework-agnostic so that the core
    can be folded into Giotto Suite later.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
